  "description": "Ancient Mediana, also referred to as the Gnotzheim fort, was a Roman military camp that was part of Upper Germanic-Raetian Limes. The site is located on what is now agricultural land in the Wei\u00dfenburg-Gunzenhausen district of Bavaria.",
